  unfold algD GlobalTheory.ThK.PolData
  congr 1
  ext Φ
  constructor
  · rintro ⟨f, φ, hf, hφ, hv, rfl⟩; exact ⟨f, hf, φ, hφ, hv, rfl⟩
  · rintro ⟨f, hf, φ, hφ, hv, rfl⟩; exact ⟨f, φ, hf, hφ, hv, rfl⟩

